      "text": "\u2022 Priority Policy Decision Matrix:\n  Match (Fault Mode, Confidence)\n\u2022 4-Level Progressive Escalation:\n  L1: In-Process Pool Recycle\n  L2: Adaptive Rate Shedding (429)\n  L3: Circuit Breaker Open (Envoy)\n  L4: Kubernetes Pod Restart/Scale\n\u2022 Anti-Flapping Cooldown Window",
